fact WorkItem(id: "WI-621", description: some(value: "carrier-neutral goal pipeline: eliminate the Value->TermId conversion in the value-precondition / ensures / guarded-effect GOAL machinery (the value_goal_term helper + its occurrence_to_term reification, consolidated in WI-602). ROOT: clause_conjuncts (split conjunction(...)) and substitute_ref_terms (apply the call substitution sigma: param->arg) are TermId-based, so a DENOTED Value::Node clause must reify via occurrence_to_term; the common Value::Term clause is already a no-op unwrap, and the resolver end (prove_from_gamma / refute_guard / flow.assume) already takes &Value. PLAN: (1) make clause_conjuncts carrier-neutral (&Value -> Vec<Value>) via the View layer head()/pos_arg() -- the same layer views_structurally_equal + the discrim tree use, so a Term / Node / Entity conjunction decomposes identically; (2) add a carrier-neutral sigma-substitution substitute_ref_terms_value that rewrites a Value::Node occurrence IN PLACE (no reification), mirroring substitute_ref_syms_value + node_occurrence::substitute_ref_syms_occ (WI-342 E2); (3) add a carrier-neutral value_references_any for the ensures caller-closed check (term_references_any today); (4) thread Value end-to-end through precondition_proved / precondition_refuted / conjunct_refuted / guarded_atom_refuted / assume_call_ensures, RETIRING value_goal_term. Aligns with WI-348 (logic never materializes a TermId from a Value), WI-342 (bridge retirement), WI-390 (denoted-in-Term). Net win: a denoted goal never reifies; Value::Term clauses unchanged. Discovered in the WI-602 dialogue (why transform ensures to Term?)."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-602"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "user", at: "2026-07-03T13:54:39Z"))

